{"ticker":"PNC","updated":"2026-10-30T23:06:23Z","profile":{"longName":"The PNC Financial Services Group, Inc.","shortName":"PNC Financial Services Group, I","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pnc.com","fullTimeEmployees":55572,"marketCap":90515693568,"trailingPE":12.13312,"forwardPE":10.678361,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.628756,"pegRatio":1.58,"targetMeanPrice":263.0,"targetHighPrice":286.0,"targetLowPrice":238.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.109,"earningsGrowth":0.143,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.41142,"profitMargins":0.31675,"totalRevenue":24944001024,"beta":0.931,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":258.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":177.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.45},"summary":"The PNC Financial Services Group, Inc. operates as a diversified financial services company in the United States. It operates through three segments: Retail Banking, Corporate & Institutional Banking, and Asset Management Group segments. The Retail Banking segment offers checking, savings, and money market accounts, and time deposit; residential mortgages, home equity loans and lines of credit, auto loans, credit cards, education loans, and personal and small business loans and lines of credit; and brokerage, insurance, and investment and cash management services. This segment serves consumer and small business customers through a network of branches, digital channels, ATMs, and through phone-based customer contact centers. The Corporate & Institutional Banking segment provides secured and unsecured loans, letters of credit, and equipment leases; cash and investment management, receivables and disbursement management, funds transfer, international payment, and access to online/mobile information management and reporting services; asset-backed financing, securities underwriting, loan syndications, mergers and acquisitions and equity capital markets advisory, and customer related services; and commercial loan servicing and technology solutions. It serves mid-sized and large corporations, and government and not-for-profit entities. The Asset Management Group segment offers investm","summary_zh":"PNC Financial Services Group, Inc. 在美國以多元化金融服務公司營運。它透過三個部門運作：零售銀行部門、企業和機構銀行部門以及資產管理集團部門。零售銀行業務部門提供支票、儲蓄、貨幣市場帳戶以及定期存款；住宅抵押貸款、房屋淨值貸款和信用額度、汽車貸款、信用卡、教育貸款以及個人和小型企業貸款和信用額度；經紀、保險、投資和現金管理服務。該部門透過分公司網路、數位管道、ATM 以及基於電話的客戶聯絡中心為消費者和小型企業客戶提供服務。企業和機構銀行業務部門提供擔保和無擔保貸款、信用證和設備租賃；現金和投資管理、應收帳款和支出管理、資金轉帳、國際支付以及線上/行動資訊管理和報告服務；資產支援融資、證券承銷、銀團貸款、併購和股權資本市場諮詢以及客戶相關服務；以及商業貸款服務和技術解決方案。它為大中型企業、政府和非營利實體提供服務。資產管理集團部門提供投資","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":205.71,"h":205.71,"l":202.7,"c":205.42,"v":1647400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":204.4,"h":205.74,"l":202.93,"c":205.0,"v":1827800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":206.24,"h":207.46,"l":205.19,"c":207.36,"v":1203300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":207.76,"h":208.8,"l":203.74,"c":204.4,"v":1273000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":204.21,"h":205.64,"l":201.13,"c":203.77,"v":1772800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":203.77,"h":204.95,"l":198.84,"c":200.41,"v":1856100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":200.97,"h":202.56,"l":200.42,"c":201.89,"v":1290600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":201.61,"h":203.53,"l":201.15,"c":202.75,"v":1271000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":202.75,"h":203.04,"l":201.59,"c":201.98,"v":1015300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":202.25,"h":205.13,"l":201.89,"c":202.46,"v":1464300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":202.59,"h":203.14,"l":198.68,"c":200.94,"v":1187400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":201.46,"h":205.84,"l":201.1,"c":203.77,"v":1387600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":203.92,"h":206.53,"l":203.4,"c":206.27,"v":1125200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":206.71,"h":206.71,"l":204.0,"c":205.52,"v":3001300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":204.12,"h":205.45,"l":202.55,"c":203.12,"v":1216700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":204.0,"h":206.79,"l":203.11,"c":203.92,"v":1310700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":203.99,"h":205.97,"l":202.59,"c":204.08,"v":1782700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":20