VN4bUYzcUR3cmhHUTU4NVpLdFU4dndIS0FrdlhZRFF0Qk4wc1l0SlJ6dGhJZVJYek9oSnhZQnc5eTZ0Vmh3WkduZ2diUUdsT0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"PNC 2026 年第三季財報電話會議：Kreditwachstum stützt NII-Ausblick"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/713676/000071367626000020/pnc-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"redeployed the full proceeds from the sale into higher-yielding investment securities. The combined impact of all of these significant items on pre-tax noninterest income and pre-tax noninterest expense in the second quarter of 2024 was $141 million and $120 million, respectively.","zh":"將出售所得的全部收益重新配置為收益較高的投資證券。所有這些重要項目對 2024 年第二季稅前非利息收入和稅前非利息支出的綜合影響分別為 1.41 億美元和 1.2 億美元。"},{"en":"On January 5, 2026, PNC completed its acquisition of FirstBank Holding Company, including its banking subsidiary, FirstBank. As of close, FirstBank had $26.4 billion of assets, $16.0 billion of loans and $23.1 billion of deposits. Effective January 5, 2026, FirstBank's financial results are included in PNC's consolidated operations and will be reported in PNC's first quarter 2026 results. Conversion of FirstBank customers to PNC Bank is expected to occur this summer. Until conversion, FirstBank will remain a separate bank subsidiary of PNC. See Note 24 Subsequent Events for additional details on the acquisition of FirstBank.","zh":"2026 年 1 月 5 日，PNC 完成了對 FirstBank Holding Company 的收購，包括其銀行子公司 FirstBank。截至收盤，FirstBank 擁有 264 億美元的資產、160 億美元的貸款和 231 億美元的存款。自 2026 年 1 月 5 日起，FirstBank 的財務表現將納入 PNC 的合併業務，並將在 PNC 2026 年第一季業績中報告。 FirstBank 客戶預計將於今年夏天轉為 PNC 銀行。在轉換之前，FirstBank 仍將是 PNC 的獨立銀行子公司。有關收購 FirstBank 的更多詳細資訊，請參閱附註 24 期後事項。"},{"en":"The following tables include selected financial data which should be reviewed in conjunction with the Consolidated Financial Statements and Notes included in Item 8 of this Report as well as the other disclosures in this Report concerning our historical financial performance, our future prospects and the risks associated with our business and financial performance:","zh":"下表包括選定的財務數據，應與本報告第 8 項中包含的合併財務報表和附註以及本報告中有關我們的歷史財務業績、未來前景以及與我們的業務和財務業績相關的風險的其他披露一起審查："}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retail Banking","val":14863000000,"zh":"零售銀行業務"},{"name":"Asset Management Group","val":1710000000,"zh":"資產管理集團部門"}],"total":23099000000}},"peers":["USB","FITB","KEY","BNY","MTB"]}}